<title>ARMENIA: Armenian GDP rises 4.5 pct in Jan-Sept.</title>
<headline>Armenian GDP rises 4.5 pct in Jan-Sept.</headline>
<dateline>YEREVAN 1996-10-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Armenian gross domestic product in the first nine months of this year was 4.5 percent higher than a year earlier in inflation-adjusted terms, the National Statistics Committee said.</p>
<p>    ARMENIA GDP		   JAN-SEP 96  JAN-AUG 96  JAN-JUL 95</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change     +4.5	  +4.2	  +5.4</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
